        "detailed_description": "<h1>Supporter Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/0ccc27363ff78e3bd79072cf4b05d28e.avif?t=1775404813\" width=1560 height=600 /></span><br>You can play this game for free, or support us by purchasing the <strong>Supporter Edition</strong>. In Supporter Edition, you can pilot <strong>MD-530F Defender</strong>, the upgraded variant of MD-500MG featuring twin minigun pylons and improved engine! Supporter Edition also supports Steam Cloud feature.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Hijong Park's Defender Patrol</strong> is a low-poly helicopter combat flight simulator featuring simple but fully interactable cockpit system, playable in both the monitor and Virtual-reality.<br><br>The game aims to be a middle ground between serious study flight simulator and arcade action for light observation helicopter, with a simple low poly graphics that resembles the flight simulators from MS-DOS era. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Semi-realistic flight model, which is a lot simpler than real life helicopters but still gives the feeling of riding a helicopter.<br></li><li>Directly interact with switches in the cockpit. You don't need to memorize tons of keybinds!<br></li><li>Offers 3 different play modes for flight sim enthusiasts:<br><ol><li><strong>Flatscreen:</strong> Play in just simple flat screen monitor with joysticks or Keyboard and mouse. Various snap view functions are available to aid your limited vision.<br></li><li><strong>TrackIR:</strong> Use your TrackIR device to quickly look around the cockpit.<br></li><li><strong>VR:</strong> Play with VR controllers alone, or mix some joysticks. Various combos are possible.</li></ol></li><li>Procedurally Generated scenes and missions offering completely unexpectable encounters during your duty!<br></li><li>Equip weapons in each 2 pylons of MD-500MG to destroy things, or carry 4 troops with MD-500E.<br><table><tr><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th></tr></table></li><li>Encounter various AI units including infantries, MANPADS, stationary turrets, armored cars, tanks, howitzers, and SPAAVs. Kill bad ones, help good ones.<br></li><li>Fly with your AI helicopter wingmen to complete missions, and fight with enemy AI helicopters.<br></li><li>Use ANVIS for night operations.<br></li><li>Out of ammo? Draw your victorious model 10 and keep fighting for your victory.</li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Hijong Park's Defender Patrol</strong> is a low-poly helicopter combat flight simulator featuring simple but fully interactable cockpit system, playable in both the monitor and Virtual-reality.<br><br>The game aims to be a middle ground between serious study flight simulator and arcade action for light observation helicopter, with a simple low poly graphics that resembles the flight simulators from MS-DOS era. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Semi-realistic flight model, which is a lot simpler than real life helicopters but still gives the feeling of riding a helicopter.<br></li><li>Directly interact with switches in the cockpit. You don't need to memorize tons of keybinds!<br></li><li>Offers 3 different play modes for flight sim enthusiasts:<br><ol><li><strong>Flatscreen:</strong> Play in just simple flat screen monitor with joysticks or Keyboard and mouse. Various snap view functions are available to aid your limited vision.<br></li><li><strong>TrackIR:</strong> Use your TrackIR device to quickly look around the cockpit.<br></li><li><strong>VR:</strong> Play with VR controllers alone, or mix some joysticks. Various combos are possible.</li></ol></li><li>Procedurally Generated scenes and missions offering completely unexpectable encounters during your duty!<br></li><li>Equip weapons in each 2 pylons of MD-500MG to destroy things, or carry 4 troops with MD-500E.<br><table><tr><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th><th><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.poster.avif?t=1775404813\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.webm?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.mp4?t=1775404813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></th></tr></table></li><li>Encounter various AI units including infantries, MANPADS, stationary turrets, armored cars, tanks, howitzers, and SPAAVs. Kill bad ones, help good ones.<br></li><li>Fly with your AI helicopter wingmen to complete missions, and fight with enemy AI helicopters.<br></li><li>Use ANVIS for night operations.<br></li><li>Out of ammo? Draw your victorious model 10 and keep fighting for your victory.</li></ul>",
